caption: Current Prey
tradition-component: current-prey

The Dreadhound may have only one Current Prey at a time. Selecting a known Pattern as Current Prey requires one minute of Concentration before Mastery. Dreadhound Hunter traits apply only to the Current Prey.

Traits with stable constructions—such as Detect, Higher Purpose, Resistant, conditional attributes, conditional defenses, penetration, specialized attacks, or tracking abilities—may be purchased normally with Only Against Current Prey, -20%, in addition to the Universal Origin modifiers. The trait must directly support hunting or countering the selected Pattern.
